      "hash": "#11",
      "title": "Experimental Controls and Responsibility",
      "section": "main",
      "visuals": 3,
      "visibleText": "Subject-grouped folds prevent knees from one person crossing train and test. Frozen shared front end, matched initialisation and out-of-fold comparison. Research prototype only. Reuse computed features and report energy limits; no clinical deployment claim.",
