      "hash": "#21",
      "title": "Conclusion and Contributions",
      "section": "main",
      "visuals": 2,
      "visibleText": "O1–O4 were completed through an auditable cohort, controlled comparison and failure-aware evaluation. The computing contribution is evidence about decoder topology—not a CT replacement or clinically ready system. Residual topology was the decisive factor. Small bones remain the main bottleneck. Clinical fracture preservation remains unproven.",
      "titleWords": 3,
      "narrativeWords": 44,
